        "step_number": 1,
        "text": "Step 1: To find the angle $\\angle ABC$, we can use the dot product formula between vectors $\\overrightarrow{BA}$ and $\\overrightarrow{BC}$. The formula for the cosine of the angle between two vectors is given by:\n\n\\[\n\\cos(\\theta) = \\frac{\\overrightarrow{BA} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{BC}}{|\\overrightarrow{BA}| |\\overrightarrow{BC}|}\n\\]"
