        "prefix_token_count": 145,
        "step_number": 2,
        "text": "Step 2: First, calculate vector $\\overrightarrow{BA}$:\n\\[\n\\overrightarrow{BA} = A - B = (1-3, -11+4, 2-1) = (-2, -7, 1)\n\\]"
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 578,
