        "prefix_token_count": 277,
        "step_number": 4,
        "text": "Step 4: Calculate the dot product $\\overrightarrow{BA} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{BC}$:\n\\[\n\\overrightarrow{BA} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{BC} = (-2)(-5) + (-7)(5) + (1)(-2) = 10 - 35 - 2 = -27\n\\]"
      },
