        "prefix_token_count": 341,
        "step_number": 5,
        "text": "Step 5: Calculate the magnitude of $\\overrightarrow{BA}$:\n\\[\n|\\overrightarrow{BA}| = \\sqrt{(-2)^2 + (-7)^2 + 1^2} = \\sqrt{4 + 49 + 1} = \\sqrt{54}\n\\]"
