        "prefix_token_count": 406,
        "step_number": 6,
        "text": "Step 6: Calculate the magnitude of $\\overrightarrow{BC}$:\n\\[\n|\\overrightarrow{BC}| = \\sqrt{(-5)^2 + 5^2 + (-2)^2} = \\sqrt{25 + 25 + 4} = \\sqrt{54}\n\\]"
      },
